kvlite (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging: kvlite-badgerdb, kvlite-boltdb, kvlite-leveldb, and
    kvlite-lmdb driver bundles plus standalone kvlite-http and kvlite-redis
    protocol modules. The installed CLI discovers versioned, checksummed
    module catalogs at runtime; see packaging/README.md. Set the package
    version from the release tag before uploading.

